		{"id":"0506c97688c23f09","type":"text","text":"## PhD Courses & Visiting\n- 2024-09, School on **coding**, Ruhr University Bochum (DE)\n- 2024-04, School on **advanced spectroscopy**, Paul Scherrer Institute (CH)\n- 2023-10, School **Machine Learning and spectroscopy,** Les Houches (FR)\n- 2023-09/12, Visiting researcher in Patrick Rinke's group, courses on **DFT for experts** and **ML for materials science** (FI)\n- 2023-06, School **Introductory Training on Spectroscopy**, Unicam, S. B. del Tronto (IT)\n- 2023-05, School on **Soft skills** (leadership and communication),  Centrum Dohody, Prague (CZ)\n- 2022-10, School in **Theoretical Chemistry and Spectroscopy**, KNCV-CTC (BE)","x":-420,"y":684,"width":460,"height":745},
